                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page5');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page5",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Kiloude City is a city in the southern part of the Kalos region."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page6');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page6",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "And it's the perfect place for Trainers looking to sharpen their skills!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page7');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page7",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "So here's your pass for the super high-speed rail to Kiloude City!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run tag @s add TMVPass');",
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run playsound minecraft:itemget ambient @s ~ ~ ~ 1 1 1');",
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run tellraw @s {\"text\":\"You received a TMV Pass to Kiloude City!\",\"italic\":true,\"color\":\"gray\"}');",
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page8');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page8",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Use it to ride the TMV super high-speed rail! Just hop on a train with your pass!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page9');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page9",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Have a fantastic time!"
            ],
